SCOPE. This licence covers the code of this replication package: 01_code/,
run_all.sh and the scripts under 00_data/. It covers no data. The one dataset
the package redistributes, the RCMIP extract
00_data/emissions/rcmip_co2_world_ssp245_ssp370.csv, remains under its own
licence, CC BY-SA 4.0; its attribution and notice are in
00_data/emissions/PROVENANCE.md. The AMOC series the code fetches before a run
is not redistributed; it is obtained from its publisher, as described in
section 1 of README.md (Data Availability Statement).
